---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-rule">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-5 py-10 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-xl tracking-tight">CAV</p>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-[0.95rem] text-ink-soft">
        The Center for the Study of Anomalous Virtues is a hybrid human-AI research
        organization mapping the philosophical and ethical
        underpinnings of moral values across human demographics.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="font-sans text-sm text-ink-soft">
      <p class="text-ink">Private research organization</p>
      <p class="mt-1">thecav.org · cav.ngo</p>
      <p class="mt-1">
        <a class="text-oxblood underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="mailto:director@thecav.org">director@thecav.org</a>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-muted">© {year} The Center for the Study of Anomalous Virtues</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
